    "created_at": "2017-09-27T12:49:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-27T12:49:03Z",
    "body": "I think it would be a nice addition to the Web Bluetooth API. There is already a [Nearby API](https://developers.google.com/nearby/messages/overview) included on smartphone since Android 2.3 and on iOS.\r\n\r\nBasically it would mirror the Java/Swift API (publish, unpublish, subscribe, unsubscribe) to broadcast or scan for around beacons in the form of a JS Buffer.\r\n\r\nThis API would requires a special permission from the user when first used by the page.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
